{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_DB94001D","title":"Banor laughs at the messages","entry":"Dlg_DB94001D::entry","exit":"Dlg_DB94001D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AAECFFC0","articyId":"72057645577588835","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Hey Boss. What can I do you for? You look like you got something on your mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey Boss. What can I do you for? You look like you got something on your mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22981","byteOffset":16578568,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_A198917B","articyId":"72057645577588858","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"You know how it is. I'm trying to make the most of my time - find a nice lady. Sadly, the dancers at the Synth Ocean Club want a tall man. Life's short... but so am I.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You know how it is. I'm trying to make the most of my time - find a nice lady. Sadly, the dancers at the Synth Ocean Club want a tall man. Life's short... but so am I.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1125.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43345","byteOffset":30726888,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_B5638D7A","articyId":"72057645577588872","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"What you wanna know?","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What you wanna know?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26944","byteOffset":18073848,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_14823826","articyId":"72057645577588894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Haha! Yeah, that sounds like Thad alright. What a character.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Haha! Yeah, that sounds like Thad alright. What a character.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23097","byteOffset":16623680,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_5681305C","articyId":"72057645577588914","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Believe he is travelling back and forth through time? Nah.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Believe he is travelling back and forth through time? Nah.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28046","byteOffset":18491704,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_3D9579E8","articyId":"72057645577588928","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Amusing himself? Goofing on you? Thaddeus is a joker, you know. Don't take it all too seriously.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Amusing himself? Goofing on you? Thaddeus is a joker, you know. Don't take it all too seriously.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3650.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46383","byteOffset":31881424,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_64CB893F","articyId":"72057645577588942","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Listen Boss, where he is, he's where he wants to be. Whether it's Luna, the Spire, another city, or.... I dunno, the beginning of creation, Thaddeus is being Thaddeus.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Listen Boss, where he is, he's where he wants to be. Whether it's Luna, the Spire, another city, or.... I dunno, the beginning of creation, Thaddeus is being Thaddeus.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4250.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20894","byteOffset":15787616,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_BB5236AC","articyId":"72057645577588955","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"For most of us here, It's hard to imagine that he even left.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For most of us here, It's hard to imagine that he even left.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17424","byteOffset":14480408,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_07A2A88E","articyId":"72057645577588964","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"I think I'll make 'em fresh when I see him with my own eyes.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think I'll make 'em fresh when I see him with my own eyes.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2350.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38173","byteOffset":28775560,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_41CF9C27","articyId":"72057821671327704","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Banor","text":"Something important. Or nonsense. One of the two.","speakerId":"Ntt_A23B2702","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Something important. Or nonsense. One of the two.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20798","byteOffset":15752040,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_B26190FD","articyId":"72057645577588844","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How are you doing, Banor?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How are you doing, Banor?","TextSheVersion":"How are you doing, Banor?","TextTheyVersion":"How are you doing, Banor?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20388","byteOffset":15596560,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_18FD87F3","articyId":"72057645577588849","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No time for chat-chit. I have to talk to you about Thaddeus.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No time for chat-chit. I have to talk to you about Thaddeus.","TextSheVersion":"No time for chat-chit. I have to talk to you about Thaddeus.","TextTheyVersion":"No time for chat-chit. I have to talk to you about Thaddeus."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":825.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16659","byteOffset":14197456,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_DFAC97D0","articyId":"72057645577588865","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Could I ask you about Thaddeus?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could I ask you about Thaddeus?","TextSheVersion":"Cou